<div class="container">
<div class="card mt-5 mb-5 no-padding">
<div class="row">
<div class="col-md-6">
<a href="https://www.fws.gov/story/how-build-pollinator-garden" target="_blank"><img src="/images/content/bag-seed-packet.jpg" width="100%" alt="eco-friendly gifts with purchase" /></a></div>
<div class="col-md-6 my-auto">
<div class="card-body">
<h2 class="roboto text-center my-auto"><font color="#636363">Earth-Friendly Gifts With Every Purchase</font></h2>
<p class="card-text"><font size="4">Reach for our reusable and recyclable grocery bag the next time you go to the store to avoid using paper or plastic. And plant the complimentary seeds to create a robust pollinator habitat near your home!</font></p>
<center><button class="btn btn-primary btn-lg"><strong><a href="https://www.fws.gov/story/how-build-pollinator-garden" target="_blank"><font color="white">LEARN MORE</font></a></strong></button></center>
</div></div></div></div></div>

<div class="container">
<div class="card mt-5 mb-5 no-padding">
<div class="row">
<div class="col-md-6">
<a href="https://corporate.perduefarms.com/news/press-releases/perdue-farms-becomes-the-first-poultry-company-in-the-united-states-to-create-a-pollinator-friendly-habitat-throughout-its-solar-installation/" target="_blank"><img src="/images/content/perdue-pollinator-habitat.jpg" width="100%" alt="pollinator friendly garden at Perdue Farms headquarters" /></a></div>
<div class="col-md-6 my-auto">
<div class="card-body">
<h2 class="roboto text-center my-auto"><font color="#636363">How We Help to Protect Pollinator Populations</font></h2>
<p class="card-text"><font size="4">In 2018, we planted 250,000 native and pollinator-friendly plants on the solar array adjacent to Perdue Farms’ headquarters in Salisbury, Maryland. In spring 2020, the plants bloomed, making us the first poultry company in the state — and the U.S.! — to have a pollinator-friendly ground cover at a company solar installation. In recognition of our efforts, we were awarded the Governor’s Citation, which was presented by Lieutenant Governor Boyd K. Rutherford.</font></p>
<center><button class="btn btn-primary btn-lg"><strong><a href="https://corporate.perduefarms.com/news/press-releases/perdue-farms-becomes-the-first-poultry-company-in-the-united-states-to-create-a-pollinator-friendly-habitat-throughout-its-solar-installation/" target="_blank"><font color="white">LEARN MORE</font></a></strong></button></center>
</div></div></div></div></div>
<div class="container">
<div class="card mt-5 mb-5 no-padding">
<div class="row">
<div class="col-md-6">
<a href="/en-US/green-farming.html"><img src="/images/content/green-farming-regenerative-agriculture.jpg" width="100%" alt="green farming" /></a></div>
<div class="col-md-6 my-auto">
<div class="card-body">
<h2 class="roboto text-center my-auto"><font color="#636363">Green Farming Methods</font></h2>
<p class="card-text"><font size="4">The farmers who partner with Perdue Farms and its family of brands work hard to keep the soil healthy, prevent runoff into our precious streams and waterways and limit the amount of carbon dioxide (C02) that is emitted into the environment.</font></p>
<center><button class="btn btn-primary btn-lg"><strong><a href="/en-US/green-farming.html"><font color="white">LEARN MORE</font></a></strong></button></center>
</div></div></div></div></div>

<div class="container">
<div class="card mt-5 mb-5 no-padding">
<div class="row">
<div class="col-md-6">
<img src="/images/content/green-circle.jpg" width="100%" alt="GreenCircle Zero Waste to Landfill certification" /></div>
<div class="col-md-6 my-auto">
<div class="card-body">
<h2 class="roboto text-center my-auto"><font color="#636363">GreenCircle Zero Waste to Landfill Certification</font></h2>
<p class="card-text"><font size="4">Our Washington, Indiana operation is GreenCircle Zero Waste to Landfill certified, which means 100% of the waste materials leaving the facility are diverted from landfill via GreenCircle’s acceptable means of diversion (reuse, recycling or incineration for energy). To receive certification, Washington went through a rigorous audit and assessment process. </font></p>
<center><button class="btn btn-primary btn-lg"><strong><a href="https://corporate.perduefarms.com/news/press-releases/perdue-farms-earns-greencircle-zero-waste-certification/" target="_blank"><font color="white">LEARN MORE</font></a></strong></button></center>
</div></div></div></div></div>
